{"id": "art-institute-federal-loan-reconciliation", "title": "The Art Institute could not reconcile a $950,875 federal student-loan balance", "seconds": 45.0, "voice": "tinyvoca:M2", "narrator": "Temporary local narration", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "86c9c9d0d5f4442c", "words": 135, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The Art Institute could not produce its federal loan statements for July through September 2019.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.12, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Missing", "loan", "statements"], "sub": "Three statements unavailable for review"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Schools had to reconcile federal cash and student disbursements each month.", "t0": 5.24, "t1": 9.17, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "Three statements unavailable for review", "text": "Monthly reconciliation", "mark": "Monthly"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The auditors also identified an unreconciled balance of $950,875.", "t0": 9.39, "t1": 15.51, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$950,875", "label": "A balance left unreconciled"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "That was the available balance reported in the federal systems.", "t0": 15.63, "t1": 18.7, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "audit", "layout": "table", "heading": "Different measures", "context": "San Francisco Art Institute", "rows": [{"label": "Direct Loan", "value": "$950,875"}, {"label": "Account", "value": "Available balance"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The audit did not identify that amount as missing student money.", "t0": 18.82, "t1": 21.83, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "A balance left unreconciled", "text": "Direct Loan account", "mark": "Direct"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "A separate Pell Grant test found a student underpaid $768.", "t0": 21.95, "t1": 26.2, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$768", "label": "A separate student payment with a receipt"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The school credited the student from its own funds.", "t0": 26.32, "t1": 28.71, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "samples", "layout": "table", "heading": "Pell Grant correction", "context": "San Francisco Art Institute", "rows": [{"label": "Underpayment", "value": "$768"}, {"label": "Correction", "value": "School credited student"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The auditors checked that payment.", "t0": 28.83, "t1": 30.31, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "samples", "kicker": "A separate student payment with a receipt", "text": "Verified correction", "mark": "Verified"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The school said it checked loan records manually each day during a software problem.", "t0": 30.53, "t1": 34.6, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "reply", "kicker": "The school described a system correction", "text": "Manual reconciliation", "mark": "Manual"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The federal handbook placed final closeout in July 2021.", "t0": 34.72, "t1": 38.13, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "reply", "kicker": "The school described a system correction", "text": "July 2021", "mark": "July"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The final reconciliation would show how the loan balance was resolved.", "t0": 38.25, "t1": 41.74, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "reply", "kicker": "The school described a system correction", "text": "Federal closeout", "mark": "Federal"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 41.86, "t1": 44.08, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}}], "audioStatus": "temporary-local", "audioProvider": "tiny-voca", "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Three statements unavailable for review", "b": "A balance left unreconciled", "o": "The school described a system correction"}, "look": "flow", "hook": "document"}